{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>A walled city.</b> A surrounded city." "<b>Days.</b> A year, until the return of the days of seed and heat and summer and winter as they were, for their cause is the return of the sun to its place. Now we need to receive the tradition regarding a full year, whether solar, whether lunar, and whether intercalated."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:23.850017233Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}